    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slap Street</strong> is a hero-based beat 'em up for 1-8 players. Slapporo City has been overrun by an elite gang, leaving it to heroes of no renown to eliminate the threat. As you punch, kick and blast your way across town, you'll unlock distinct heroes, wield an assortment of weapons, and unleash an arsenal of combos, throws, and special attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNLOCK AND DISCOVER EACH HEROES PLAYSTYLE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430840/extras/8c104c9c046ddde65c244fcc2fdafabe.poster.avif?t=1745304349\" width=616 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430840/extras/8c104c9c046ddde65c244fcc2fdafabe.webm?t=1745304349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430840/extras/8c104c9c046ddde65c244fcc2fdafabe.mp4?t=1745304349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your way through five stages of mayhem in classic beat 'em up action and save Slapporo City! Unlock new heroes and play <strong>Arcade</strong> mode again and again, every hero has a unique experience to offer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT WITH YOUR FRIENDS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430840/extras/f7090b3f52a7c3d257d406d04d5d1288.poster.avif?t=1745304349\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430840/extras/f7090b3f52a7c3d257d406d04d5d1288.webm?t=1745304349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430840/extras/f7090b3f52a7c3d257d406d04d5d1288.mp4?t=1745304349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flex on your friends in <strong>Versus</strong> to see who is the ultimate hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RELAX WITH PARTY MODE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a casual experience in <strong>Party</strong> mode and unleash havoc in a number of mini games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Beat 'em up action with up to 8 players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Intuitive combo and magic system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Beautiful full-color retro graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Five dynamic  city regions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf A growing roster of unlockable heroes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Story mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Versus mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Endless mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Party mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
